      "speakerId": "CUSTOMER",
      "role": "CUSTOMER",
      "user_id": 19352,
      "start_timestamp_usec": 1769300965599999
    },
    {
      "text": "Okay, I can certainly look into that for you. Do you have the order number handy?",
